    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43482" root="&#xA;                        مأن&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَؤونَةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A weight,</i> or <i>burden.</i> (Mgh, Msb.)
See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِثْقَالٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Trouble, molestation,</i> or <i>embarrassment;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤْنَةٌ</span></b> : pl. of the former
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَؤُونَاتٌ</span>; and of the latter <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَنٌ</span>. (MA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  The
<i>requisite means of subsistence.</i> (KL.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَؤُونَةُ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الجِمَاعِ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَافِنَةٌ</span>: it seems to mean <i>the pudendum muliebre considered as the means of</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِمَاع</span>.

